  "description": "Experience a fun collision of cosmic charm and street culture with the adorably chic Alien Streetwear Illustration. This design captures a delightful retro-infused alien decked out in oversized urban attire, creating a playful yet edgy aesthetic. Immerse yourself in a vibrant world of graffiti-inspired doodles and galaxy-touched graphics, all brought to life with eye-catching neon accents. With its throwback Y2K vibes, this illustration is a stunning choice for fashion-forward oversized wear that radiates cool, cosmic vibes. Enjoy the design in high resolution – served with a PNG transparent background for your convenience.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Experience a fun collision of cosmic charm and street culture with the adorably chic Alien Streetwear Illustration. This design captures a delightful retro-infused alien decked out in oversized urban attire, creating a playful yet edgy aesthetic. Immerse yourself in a vibrant world of graffiti-inspired doodles and galaxy-touched graphics, all brought to life with eye-catching neon accents. With its throwback Y2K vibes, this illustration is a stunning choice for fashion-forward oversized wear that radiates cool, cosmic vibes. Enjoy the design in high resolution – served with a PNG transparent background for your convenience.</p>",
